        <key>construction</key>
        <string>Retain the genuine same-cut SC Z top and upper diagonal. Remove its flat lower bar and replace the lower terminal with the purpose-coded native U0240 swash. Fit both diagonal edges through the baseline using two measured straight diagonal guides, blending only below baseline to an unchanged translated deep swash. Do not paste a swash under a retained flat Z bar, reduce a whole capital or use a reference outline.</string>
